rsPick\': False}, \'finance\': {\'premiumFinance\': {\'isPremiumNews\': False, \'isPremiumFreeNews\': False}}, \'storyline\': None}', '{\'id\': \'3733040f-ca67-3706-bb76-0c2601eb765f\', \'contentType\': \'STORY\', \'title\': \'Indian billionaire Ambani to meet Trump, Qatar emir in Doha, sources say\', \'description\': \'\', \'summary\': "NEW DELHI (Reuters) -Indian billionaire Mukesh Ambani will meet U.S. President Donald Trump and the emir of Qatar in Doha on Wednesday, two sources told Reuters, as his company Reliance Industries looks to foster ties with authorities in both nations.  Qatar\'s sovereign wealth fund, QIA, has invested in Reliance businesses over the years, and Ambani, who is Asia\'s richest man, has many business partnerships with the likes of U.S. tech giants such as Google and Meta.  Ambani will attend a state dinner for Trump at the Lusail Palace in Doha, but did not plan to hold any investment or business discussions, said the first source, who had direct knowledge of the matter.", \'pubDate\': \'2025-05-14T09:08:43Z\', \'displayTime\': \'2025-05-14T09:08:43Z\', \'isHosted\': True, \'bypassModal\': False, \'previewUrl\': None, \'thumbnail\': {\'originalUrl\': \'https://media.zenfs.com/en/reuters-finance.com/f79808db95b5eba52463805745f17d86\', \'originalWidth\': 800, \'originalHeight\': 533, \'caption\': \'Vibrant Gujarat Global Summit, in Gandhinagar\', \'resolutions\': [{\'url\': \'https://s.yimg.com/uu/api/res/1.2/htbhm6Cq9xaBPdxvZdWKkg--~B/aD01MzM7dz04MDA7YXBwaWQ9eXRhY2h5b24-/https://media.zenfs.com/en/reuters-finance.com/f79808db95b5eba52463805745f17d86\', \'width\': 800, \'height\': 533, \'tag\': \'original\'}, {\'url\': \'https://s.yimg.com/uu/api/res/1.2/Z.8vQN0k4QsVbd2PoPyuXw--~B/Zmk9c3RyaW07aD0xMjg7dz0xNzA7YXBwaWQ9eXRhY2h5b24-/https://media.zenfs.com/en/reuters-finance.com/f79808db95b5eba52463805745f17d86\', \'width\': 170, \'height\': 128, \'tag\': \'170x128\'}]}, \'provider\': {\'displayName\': \'Reuters\', \'url\': \'http://www.reute