- {'id': '4bfce8a9-2116-30eb-94ea-75ba088ddb5f', 'contentType': 'STORY', 'title': "India's HDFC Bank hits four-month high as deposit rate cut seen lifting margins", 'description': '', 'summary': "Shares of India's HDFC Bank rose as much as 4% on Tuesday to 1,876.80 rupees and were set for their best day in 10 months, after its deposit rate cuts were seen as a margin boost amid slowing loan growth in the industry.  India's largest private lender rose to 1,876.80 rupees as of 8:53 a.m. GMT, its highest since early December, after the bank cut savings deposit rates by 25 basis points across tiers - its first cut in the under-5-million-rupee ($58,263) category in five years.  Brokerage Macquarie said the rate cut could boost HDFC Bank's margins by five basis points starting the first quarter of fiscal 2026, while Jefferies estimated it would reduce costs on 23% of its deposits.", 'pubDate': '2025-04-15T08:47:24Z', 'displayTime': '2025-04-15T08:47:24Z', 'isHosted': True, 'bypassModal': False, 'previewUrl': None, 'thumbnail': {'originalUrl': 'https://media.zenfs.com/en/reuters.com/c16af189f4dcc9f240b5a384acfa4c16', 'originalWidth': 800, 'originalHeight': 552, 'caption': "The headquarters of India's HDFC bank is pictured in Mumbai", 'resolutions': [{'url': 'https://s.yimg.com/uu/api/res/1.2/Y8sX7nGUC5jgaucS6RtWLg--~B/aD01NTI7dz04MDA7YXBwaWQ9eXRhY2h5b24-/https://media.zenfs.com/en/reuters.com/c16af189f4dcc9f240b5a384acfa4c16', 'width': 800, 'height': 552, 'tag': 'original'}, {'url': 'https://s.yimg.com/uu/api/res/1.2/OM1nWpXIr62T21H_fAkbLw--~B/Zmk9c3RyaW07aD0xMjg7dz0xNzA7YXBwaWQ9eXRhY2h5b24-/https://media.zenfs.com/en/reuters.com/c16af189f4dcc9f240b5a384acfa4c16', 'width': 170, 'height': 128, 'tag': '170x128'}]}, 'provider': {'displayName': 'Reuters', 'url': 'https://www.reuters.com/'}, 'canonicalUrl': {'url': 'https://sg.finance.yahoo.com/news/indias-hdfc-bank-hits-four-084724842.html', 'site': 'finance', 'region': 'SG', 'lang': 'en-SG'}, 'clickThroughUrl': {'url': 'https: