- {'id': '2fe253a0-593b-3021-b5f3-dc0736ca4672', 'contentType': 'STORY', 'title': 'Indian benchmarks log biggest five-day gains in four years as financials rally', 'description': '', 'summary': "India's benchmark indexes logged their biggest five-day gains since February 2021, boosted by heavyweight financials following better-than-expected earnings, while a weaker U.S. dollar further propped up investor sentiment.  The Nifty 50  gained 1.15% to 24,125.55 on Monday, while the BSE Sensex rose 1.09% to 79,408.50.  Financials, which comprise over 37% of the Nifty 50, have jumped 9.5% in five sessions and hit lifetime highs.", 'pubDate': '2025-04-21T02:43:42Z', 'displayTime': '2025-04-21T02:43:42Z', 'isHosted': True, 'bypassModal': False, 'previewUrl': None, 'thumbnail': {'originalUrl': 'https://media.zenfs.com/en/reuters.com/a29b30409a67269f7ab6188accf2caa9', 'originalWidth': 800, 'originalHeight': 542, 'caption': 'Men walk past a screen displaying market results outside the Bombay Stock Exchange (BSE) in Mumbai', 'resolutions': [{'url': 'https://s.yimg.com/uu/api/res/1.2/0wNn94tQJHO66RPLDPPPrg--~B/aD01NDI7dz04MDA7YXBwaWQ9eXRhY2h5b24-/https://media.zenfs.com/en/reuters.com/a29b30409a67269f7ab6188accf2caa9', 'width': 800, 'height': 542, 'tag': 'original'}, {'url': 'https://s.yimg.com/uu/api/res/1.2/leb_zy8aFZk9jKpa1IukhQ--~B/Zmk9c3RyaW07aD0xMjg7dz0xNzA7YXBwaWQ9eXRhY2h5b24-/https://media.zenfs.com/en/reuters.com/a29b30409a67269f7ab6188accf2caa9', 'width': 170, 'height': 128, 'tag': '170x128'}]}, 'provider': {'displayName': 'Reuters', 'url': 'https://www.reuters.com/'}, 'canonicalUrl': {'url': 'https://sg.finance.yahoo.com/news/indian-benchmarks-likely-open-flat-024342790.html', 'site': 'finance', 'region': 'SG', 'lang': 'en-SG'}, 'clickThroughUrl': {'url': 'https://finance.yahoo.com/news/indian-benchmarks-likely-open-flat-024342790.html', 'site': 'finance', 'region': 'US', 'lang': 'en-US'}, 'metadata': {'editorsPick': False}, 'finance': {'premiumFinance': {'isPremiumNews